stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft

    Draft --> Ready: gh pr ready
    Ready --> Validating: release-gate dispatched
    Validating --> Merging: gate green
    Validating --> ForwardFix: gate failed
    ForwardFix --> Validating: implementer commits fix
    ForwardFix --> Blocked: forward-fix budget (5) exhausted
    Merging --> Merged: gh pr merge
    Merging --> Draft: merge conflict
    Merged --> [*]
    Blocked --> [*]: human intervention required

    note right of ForwardFix
      `iterate-one-issue --resume-pr`
      drives this loop. Per-PR attempt
      counter via PR-comment markers.
    end note
